    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>This is a work of fiction. Names, characters, businesses, places, events and incidents are either the products of the author\u2019s imagination or used in a fictitious manner. Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, or actual events is purely coincidental.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a prisoner in prison and operate a sewing machine. Use various methods to make him operate faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your speed through various items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/dc8ba8489f885b79be3da91025b527df.poster.avif?t=1730118332\" width=452 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/dc8ba8489f885b79be3da91025b527df.webm?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/dc8ba8489f885b79be3da91025b527df.mp4?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not cool enough? There are many characters to choose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/3b4c8b12a762005c7b281ca9c6f0f348.poster.avif?t=1730118332\" width=300 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/3b4c8b12a762005c7b281ca9c6f0f348.webm?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/3b4c8b12a762005c7b281ca9c6f0f348.mp4?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desktop Pet Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allows you to do other things while watching your character operate the sewing machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/c113acfb4c3e53faab69dbc7eafe93ec.poster.avif?t=1730118332\" width=556 height=538 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/c113acfb4c3e53faab69dbc7eafe93ec.webm?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/c113acfb4c3e53faab69dbc7eafe93ec.mp4?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>This is a work of fiction. Names, characters, businesses, places, events and incidents are either the products of the author\u2019s imagination or used in a fictitious manner. Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, or actual events is purely coincidental.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a prisoner in prison and operate a sewing machine. Use various methods to make him operate faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your speed through various items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/dc8ba8489f885b79be3da91025b527df.poster.avif?t=1730118332\" width=452 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/dc8ba8489f885b79be3da91025b527df.webm?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/dc8ba8489f885b79be3da91025b527df.mp4?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not cool enough? There are many characters to choose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/3b4c8b12a762005c7b281ca9c6f0f348.poster.avif?t=1730118332\" width=300 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/3b4c8b12a762005c7b281ca9c6f0f348.webm?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/3b4c8b12a762005c7b281ca9c6f0f348.mp4?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desktop Pet Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allows you to do other things while watching your character operate the sewing machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/c113acfb4c3e53faab69dbc7eafe93ec.poster.avif?t=1730118332\" width=556 height=538 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/c113acfb4c3e53faab69dbc7eafe93ec.webm?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103820/extras/c113acfb4c3e53faab69dbc7eafe93ec.mp4?t=1730118332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
